WEBVTT

00:00:56.872 --> 00:01:00.912
humans are prone to tailor their behavior
in the presence of others

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:02.315
to garner approval.

00:01:02.766 --> 00:01:05.084
We spend valuable time putting on make up,

00:01:05.108 --> 00:01:08.012
choosing the right picture
and Instagram filter,

00:01:08.036 --> 00:01:10.798
and composing ideas
that will undoubtedly change the world

00:01:10.822 --> 00:01:12.555
in 140 characters or less.

00:01:13.561 --> 00:01:16.585
Clearly, our concern
with how other people will evaluate us

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.542
is a big part of being human.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:22.220
Despite this being
a big human trait, however,

00:01:22.244 --> 00:01:25.014
we know relatively little
about when and how

00:01:25.038 --> 00:01:27.268
we come to care
about the opinion of others.

00:01:27.649 --> 00:01:30.849
Now, this is a big question
that requires many studies.